# Repository License

This repository separates original project code from official law texts.

## Code, schemas, and automation

Scripts, JSON schemas, CI configuration, and other original software files in
`betikler/`, `semalar/`, and `.github/` are licensed under the MIT License. See
`LICENSE-CODE`.

## Official law texts

Law texts under `kanunlar/` are sourced from official public sources. This
repository does not claim copyright over official legal texts and does not grant
rights that belong to official publishers, public authorities, or other
rightsholders.

Users should verify every legal text against the official source before relying
on it. See `NOTICE.md`.

## Contributions

By contributing to this repository, you agree that your contribution is provided
under the applicable terms above:

- original code, schemas, and automation under the MIT License in
  `LICENSE-CODE`;
- official legal text updates as source-backed reproductions of official public
  legal texts, with no additional copyright claim by the contributor.
